.next/
out/
build/
dist/
.open-next/

# Generated Artifacts
dist-assets/
bundles/
*.tar.gz
# scripts/rename-for-ghp.mjs staging output (interim GitHub Packages channel)
.ghp-staging/
# `bootstrap.js` / `bootstrap` / `server` were the output of the Bun
# bootstrap→bytecode-binary spike (scripts/build-bootstrap.sh, bundle-assets.ts,
# generate-bun-manifest.ts, spike-pipeline.sh). All four scripts are deleted, so
# nothing produces these names any longer. The current opt-in Bun single-executable
# path is examples/bun-exec/ (ADR-0036), whose output is covered by the
# `apps/*/**/*-server` rule below. Kept only so a stale local file from the old
# pipeline cannot be committed by someone with an old checkout; safe to drop later.
bootstrap.js
bootstrap
server

